(29228,'chemistry',68,1113,2659,'Read the Statement - A and Statement - B carefully and mark the correct option.<div class="matching-question"><div class="column-left"><img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/68_29228_qtext_1.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' />  under Clemmensen  reduction conditions will give  https://res.cloudinary.com/doe6oiv2h/image/upload/v1764949374/preptracker/questions/q_29228_col1_1764949373885.png</div><div class="column-right"><img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/68_29228_qtext_3.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' />  under Wolff - Kishner reduction conditions will give  https://res.cloudinary.com/doe6oiv2h/image/upload/v1764949376/preptracker/questions/q_29228_col2_1764949375632.png</div></div>','[{"text": "Statement A is true but Statement B is false.", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both Statement A and Statement B are  true.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Statement A is false but Statement B is true.", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both Statement A and Statement B are  false.", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'In clemmensen reduction conditions, acid derivatives are hydrolysed to acids and carbonyl group is reduced to $-\\mathrm{CH}_{2}-$ group.<br><img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/68_29228_explanation_1.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' /> <br>In wolf-kishner reduction, carbonyl group is reduced to $-\\mathrm{CH}_{2}-$ group. Here -Cl is present, so undergoes dehydrogenation in presence of base. <img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/68_29228_explanation_2.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' />',NULL,'Hard','MCQ type-2',2023,'JEE','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
