(29428,'chemistry',68,1119,2686,'Match the Column I with Column II and choose the corrcet combination from the options given<div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "A - S,\\tB - Q,\\tC - R,\\tD - P", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "A - Q, \\tB - R,\\tC - P, \\t\\tD - S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - P,\\tB - Q,\\tC - R, \\tD - S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - R,\\tB - S,\\tC - Q,\\tD - P", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Ethanoicacid is known as Vinegar. Hexanedioicacid is monomer of Nylon 6,6.Sodium benzoate is food preservative. Salts of fatty acids are used as soaps and detergents.',NULL,'Easy','Match the following',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','chemistry/68_29428_question_1.png'),
