(29721,'chemistry',68,1113,2656,'What will be the order of reactivity of the following carbonyl compounds with Grignard\'s reagent? <br> <br> <br> <br>','[{"text": "I $>$ II $>$ III $>$ IV", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "IV $>$ III $>$ II $>$ I", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "II $>$ I $>$ IV $>$ III", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "III $>$ II $>$ I $>$ IV", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'As the number and the size of the alkyl groups increase, reactivity decreases. <br> Hence, the reactivity order is <br> <img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/68_29721_explanation_1.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' />',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','chemistry/68_29721_question_1.png'),
