(29817,'chemistry',67,1083,2591,'Match Column I with Column II.<div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{P,B}} - {\\\\rm{Q,C}} - {\\\\rm{R,D}} - {\\\\rm{S}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{S,B}} - {\\\\rm{P,C}} - {\\\\rm{Q,D}} - {\\\\rm{R}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{Q,B}} - {\\\\rm{P,C}} - {\\\\rm{S,D}} - {\\\\rm{R}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "${\\\\rm{A}} - {\\\\rm{R,B}} - {\\\\rm{S,C}} - {\\\\rm{P,D}} - {\\\\rm{Q}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'<img src=\'/img/data/chemistry/67_29817_explanation_1.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' />  $\\begin{array}{lllll}\\mathrm{pK}_{\\mathrm{a}}: & 15.9 & 10.0 & 8.3 & 7.1\\end{array}$<br>Higher the value of ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{a}}}}$, lower the value of ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{pK}_{\\mathrm{a}}}}$ stronger is the acid. Phenol and substituted phenols have higher ${\\mathrm{\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{a}}}}$ values than alcohols. Acidic strength ${\\mathrm{\\propto-\\mathrm{I},-\\mathrm{M}}}$ groups. So, correct option is (3).',NULL,'Medium','Match the following',2024,'JEE Main','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','chemistry/67_29817_question_1.png'),
