(30160,'chemistry',70,1245,3026,'Consider the following statements.<br>I. Carbohydrates, proteins, nucleic acids, and lipids all are biomolecules.<br>II. Biomolecules are the organic compounds.<br>III. Plants and animals are made up of biomolecules.<br>Select the correct statements and mark the correct option.','[{"text": "Only I", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Only II", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Only III", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "I, II and III", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Biomolecules are organic compounds. Plants and animals are made up of biomolecules. Lipids, proteins, carbohydrates, nucleic acids are biomolecules.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
