(30295,'physics',12,70,277,'When a body is earth connected, electrons from the earth flow into the body. This means the  body is','[{"text": "Charged negatively", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Charged positively", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "An insulator", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Unchanged", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'When a positively charged body is connected to earth, then electrons flows from earth to the body.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
