(46217,'physics',41,404,803,'The binding energies of the nuclei $A$ and $B$ are $E_{a}$ and $E_{b}$ respectively. Three nuclei of the element $B$ fuse to give one nucleus of element \' $A$ \' and an energy \' $Q$ \' is released. Then $E_{a}, E_{b}$, $Q$ are related','[{"text": "$E_{a}-3 E_{b}=Q$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$E_{b}-3 E_{a}=Q$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$E_{a}+3 E_{b}=Q$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$E_{b}+3 E_{a}=Q$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Given reaction $3 B \\rightarrow A$<br>Energy released $=B E$ of products $-B E$ of reactants.<br>$\\Rightarrow Q=E_{a}-3 E_{b}$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
