(46225,'physics',41,404,803,'Consider the nuclear reaction:<br>$X^{200} \\rightarrow A^{110}+B^{90}+$ Energy<br>The binding energy per nucleon for ${X^{200}},{A^{100}},{B^{90}}$ are respectively $7.4\\,MeV,8.2\\,MeV$ and $8.2\\,MeV$. The energy released is','[{"text": "$200\\\\,MeV$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$160\\\\,MeV$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$110\\\\,MeV$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$90\\\\,MeV$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Energy released $=B E$ of products $-B E$ of reactants.<br>$Q = 90 \\times 8.2 + 110 \\times 8.2 - 200 \\times 7.4$<br>$ = 8.2 \\times 200 - 200 \\times 7.4$<br>$ = 200 \\times 0.8$<br>$ = 160\\,MeV.$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(46226,'physics',42,323,591,'The current through any $p-n$ junction is due  to<br>A. Drift of charge carriers<br>B. Diffusion of  charge carriers<br>C. Different concentrations of same type of charge carriers in different regions<br>D. Same concentrations of same type of charge carriers in different regions','[{"text": "$A$, $B$ and $C$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$A$ and $B$  only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "only $D$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$A$, $B$, $C$ and $D$", "isCorrect": false}]',0,NULL,NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(46229,'physics',41,404,802,'In nuclear fission $0.1 \\%$ mass is converted into Energy. The energy released in the fission of $1\\,kg$ mass is','[{"text": "$2.5 \\\\times {10^5}\\\\,kWh$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$2.5 \\\\times {10^7}\\\\,kWh$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "$2.5 \\\\times {10^9}\\\\,kWh$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$2.5 \\\\times {10^-7}\\\\,kWh$", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'$E=\\dfrac{0.1}{100} m c^{2}$; in $k W h=\\dfrac{E}{36 \\times 10^{5}}$<br>$Q({\\rm{in}}\\,kWh) = \\frac{{0.1}}{{100}}\\frac{{m{c^2}}}{{36 \\times {{10}^5}}}$<br>$ = \\frac{{0.1}}{{100}} \\times \\frac{{1 \\times 9 \\times {{10}^{16}}}}{{36 \\times {{10}^5}}}$<br>$ = \\frac{{0.1}}{4} \\times {10^9} = 2.5 \\times {10^7}kWh.$',NULL,'Medium','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
