(47855,'biology',10,269,527,'Sometimes a few chromosomes have non staining secondary constrictions at a constant location. This gives the appearance of a small fragment called the ________.','[{"text": "Satellite", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Kinetochore", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Nucleoli", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of the above", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Sometimes a few chromosomes have non-staining secondary constrictions at a constant location. This gives the appearance of a small fragment called the satellite.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
