(47869,'biology',10,269,527,'The site of active ribosomal RNA synthesis is','[{"text": "Nucleolus", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Mitochondria", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Cytoplasm", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Nucleus", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Nucleolus is a site for active ribosomal RNA synthesis. Larger and more numerous nucleoli are present in cells actively carrying out protein synthesis.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
