(48007,'biology',10,262,517,'The golgi apparatus (Dictyosome)-','[{"text": "Is found in animal cells only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Is found in prokaryotes only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Packages and modifies proteins", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Is the site of ribosome synthesis", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'A number of proteins synthesised by ribosomes on the endoplasmic reticulum are modified in the cisternae of the golgi apparatus before they are released from its trans face.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
