(48011,'biology',10,262,517,'The endomembrane cell organelle with distinct cis and trans faces is','[{"text": "Endoplasmic reticulum", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Golgi complex", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Vacuole", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Lysosome", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Varied number of cisternae are present in a Golgi complex. The Golgi cisternae are concentrically arranged near the nucleus with distinct convex cis or the forming face and concave trans or the maturing face.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
