(48088,'biology',10,259,513,'The following figure shows some of the missing structures in a plant cell (A-E). Identify the structures.<br>','[{"text": "A - Nucleus, B - Golgi apparatus,\\nC - Chloroplast, D - Plasmodesmata,\\nE - Mitochondrion", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - Plasmodesmata, B - Chloroplast,\\nC - Nucleus, D - Golgi apparatus,\\nE - Mitochondrion", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - Nucleus, B - Plasmodesmata,\\nC - Golgi apparatus, D - Chloroplast,\\nE - Mitochondrion", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - Nucleus, B - Golgi apparatus,\\nC - Mitochondrion, D - Chloroplast,\\nE - Plasmodesmata", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'A - Nucleus, B - Golgi apparatus,<br> C - Mitochondrion, D - Chloroplast,<br> E - Plasmodesmata',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/10_48088_question_1.png'),
(48089,'biology',10,259,513,'Which of the following statements are true about Eukaryotes?<br>i. All of them have chemicallly complexed cell wall<br>ii. They have extensive compartmentaisation<br>iii. Endoplasmic reticulum is present in eukaryotes.','[{"text": "ii and iii", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "i and iii", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "i and ii", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All are correct", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'ii. They have extensive compartmentaisation<br> iii. Endoplasmic reticulum is present in Eukaryotes. These are correct statements.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48090,'biology',10,259,513,'Identify A and B in the given diagram?<br>','[{"text": "A - Plant cell, B - Animal cell", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "A - Animal cell, B - Plant cell", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - Animal cell, B - Prokaryotic cell", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "A - Prokaryotic cell, B - Plant cell", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'(1) A - Plant cell, B - Animal cell',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/10_48090_question_1.png'),
(48091,'biology',10,259,513,'Plant cell never possess','[{"text": "Centrioles", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Vacuoles", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Plastids", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Cell wall", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Generally centrioles are present in animal cell, but not in plant cell, but some lower plants like Mosses, and Ferns contain centrioles',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48092,'biology',10,259,513,'Plants cell differs from animals cell in having -','[{"text": "Cell membrane, plastid and cell wall", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Cell wall, plastid, centriole", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Chloroplast, plastid and cell wall", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Large vacuole, plastid and cell wall", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Plant and animal cells are different as plant cells possess cell wall, plastids and a large vacuole, which are absent in animal cells. On the other hand, animal cell have centrioles, which are absent in almost all plant cells. Chloroplast is absent in animal cell.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48093,'biology',10,259,513,'In eukaryotic cells, why there is an extensive compartmentalization of cytoplasm?','[{"text": "Due to the absence of membranous\\norganelles", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Due to the presence of so many organelles", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Due to the presence of organelles", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Due to the presence of membranous\\norganelles", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Due to presence of membranous organelles in eukaryotic cell there is extensive compartmentalization of cytoplasm.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48094,'biology',10,259,513,'Identify which organism have genetic material organised into chromosomes?','[{"text": "Prokaryotic cell", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Virus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Eukaryotic cell", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Viriods", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'A Eukaryotic cell has genetic material in the form of genomic DNA enclosed within the nucleus. Genes or the hereditary units are located on the chromosomes which exist as chromatin network in the non dividing cell.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48095,'biology',10,259,513,'Which one of the following is absent in animal cell?','[{"text": "Cellwall only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Plastids and cell wall", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Plastids only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Cytoplasm", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Animal cells lack plastids. Plants are autotrophs and synthesize their food in the process of photosynthesis with the help of chloroplast (Plastids).',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48096,'biology',10,259,513,'Which of the following is correct in plant cell?','[{"text": "Absence of cell membrane", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Bigger vacuole with rigid cell wall", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Centrioles and centrosome are present", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "DNA is absent", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Plant and animal cells are different as the former, possesses cell walls. Plasmids and large vacuole are absent in animal cells. Animal cells, have centrioles which are absent in almost all plant cells.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48097,'biology',10,259,513,'Which of the following shows extensive compartmentalisation?','[{"text": "Nostoc", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Bacteria", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Archaebacteria", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Plasmodium", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Plasmodium is a protista having eukaryotic cell.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48098,'biology',10,259,513,'The eukaryotes include-','[{"text": "Kingdom Fungi", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Kingdom Protista", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Kingdom Plantae and animalia", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Except Monera, the cell of the members all the other kingdoms have eukaryotic organisation, e.g. protists, fungi and plants. A eukaryotic cell is the one, which has an organised nucleus and several membrane bound cell organelles.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
