(48109,'biology',10,258,512,'The size of prokaryotic ribosomes is','[{"text": "15 – 20 nm", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "15 – 20 mm", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "10 – 15 nm", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "10 – 15 mm", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'The size of prokaryotic ribosome is 15-20 nm and is made up two subunits – 50S and 30S units which when present together form 70S Prokaryotic ribosome.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
