(48195,'biology',10,257,508,'Identify the location of the ribosomes found in prokaryotic cells?','[{"text": "Chloroplast", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Mitochondria", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Cytoplasm", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "All of these", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Membrane bound organelles like mitochondria and chloroplast are absent in prokaryotic cells. Ribosome is present in the cytoplasm of prokaryotic cells.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
