(48215,'biology',10,256,507,'Cells divide and new cells are formed from preexisting cells, the concept was given by_________','[{"text": "Matthias Schleiden", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Theodor Schwann", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Rudolf Virchow", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Rudolf Schwann", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Cells divide and new cells are formed from preexisting cells, the concept was given by Rudolf Virchow.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48216,'biology',10,256,507,'Schwann proposed cell theory according to which','[{"text": "Bodies of animals and plants are made up of cells", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All living organisms are composed of cells and products of cells", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both 1 and 2", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "A new cell always develops by the division of pre-existing cells", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Schwann proposed cell theory according to which bodies of animals and plants are made up of cells and their products. He studies different types of animal cells and plant cell and hypothesised about the postulate of cell theory',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48217,'biology',10,256,507,'Schleiden and Schwann’s cell theory could not explain','[{"text": "Body of plants are composed of cells", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Formation of new cells", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Body of animals are composed of cells", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of the above", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Cell theory proposed by Schleiden and Schwann could not explain formation of new cells, which is explained by Rudolf Virchow who gave the final shape to the cell theory.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48218,'biology',10,256,507,'Cell theory was formulated by','[{"text": "Matthias Schleiden and Theodore Schwann", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Rudolf Virchow and Theodore Schwann", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Matthias Schleiden and Robert Brown", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Theodore Schleiden and Matthias Schwann", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Cell theory was formulated by Matthias Schleiden and Theodore Schwan in the year 1839 based on their studies on plants and animals cells and their products.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48219,'biology',10,256,507,'‘Cell wall is a unique structure of plant cells’. Who concluded this?','[{"text": "Theodore Schleiden", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Matthias Schleiden", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both (1) and (2)", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Theodore Schwann", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Based on his studies on plant tissues, Theodore Schwann concluded that the presence of cell wall is a unique character of plant cells.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48220,'biology',10,256,507,'Who proposed the hypothesis that the bodies of animals and plants are composed of cells and product of cells?','[{"text": "Theodore Schleiden", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Theodore Schwann", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Both (1) and (2)", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Matthias Schleiden", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Theodore Schwann a british zoologist proposed the hypothesis that the bodies of animals and plants are composed of cells and products of cells.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48221,'biology',10,256,507,'Identify the year Schwann studied different types of animal cells?','[{"text": "1839", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "1739", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1838", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1938", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'In 1839 Theodore Schwann studied different types of animal cells.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48222,'biology',10,256,507,'The cell has a thin outer layer which is known as ‘Plasma membrane’. Name the scientist who identified this?','[{"text": "Theodore Schleiden", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Theodore Schwann", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Matthias Schleiden", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Matthias Schwann", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'In 1839 Theodore Schwan studied different types of animal cells and reported that cells have a thin outer layer which is today known as plasma membrane.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48223,'biology',10,256,507,'Identify the botanist who examined a large number of plants?','[{"text": "Matthias Schleiden", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Matthias Schwann", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Rudolf Virchow", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Theodore Schwann", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'In 1838, Matthias Schleiden, a German botanist examined a large number of plants and observed that all plants are composed of different kinds of cells which form the tissues of the plant.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48224,'biology',10,256,507,'Identify the year Schleiden observed that all plants are composed of different kinds of cells which form the tissues of the plant and the nationality to which he belonged?','[{"text": "1839, British", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1838, British", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "1838, German", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "1839, German", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Matthias Schleiden was a German botanist. In 1938 he observed that all plants are composed of different kinds of cells which form the tissues of the plant.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48225,'biology',10,256,507,'Who among the following proposed cell theory?','[{"text": "Schleiden", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Schwann", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Both (1) and (2)", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "None of these", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'In 1838, Matthias Schleiden, a German botanist examined a large number of plants and observed that all plants are composed of different kinds of cells which form the tissues of the plant. In 1839. Theodore Schwann, a British zoologist studied different types of animal cells and reported that cells had a thin outer layer which is today known as Plasma membrane.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48226,'biology',10,256,507,'The most likely method, used to determine the structural details of the cell is','[{"text": "Ultrasonography", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Microdissection", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Electron microscopy", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Simple microscope", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'Electron microscope is the best device that is used to determine the ultrastructure of a cell organelle. It can magnify objects up to 250000-400000 times. Its resolving power is 1000 times more than the light microscope.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
