(48284,'biology',101,572,1151,'According to WHO, reproductive health means a total well-being in all aspects of reproduction like.','[{"text": "Physical, Emotional, Behavioral, Social", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Physical, Mental health, Sexual Habits, Healthy body", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Physical, Mental, Behavioral, Development of sexual organs", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Physical, Mental, Emotional, Social", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'Reproductive health implies that people are able to have a responsible, satisfying and safer sex life and that they have the capability to reproduce and the freedom to decide if, when and how often to do so.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
