(48328,'biology',101,574,1153,'Intensely lactating mothers do not generally conceive due to','[{"text": "Hyper secretion of gonadotropins", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Suppression of gonadotropins", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Suppression of fertilization", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Suppression of gameteic transport", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Post parturition during intense lactation, there is Suppression of gonadotropins which inhibits ovulation and thus the women lacks the menstrual cycle during this period. Thus coitus during this time will not lead to conception. Thus this is a natural method of contraception called lactation amenorrhea.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
(48329,'biology',101,574,1153,'As long as the mother breast-feeds the child fully, chances of conception are almost nil. It is a feature of','[{"text": "Coitus interruptus", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Lactational amenorrhoea", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "periodic abstinence", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Rhythm method", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Post parturition during intense lactation, there is Suppression of gonadotropins which inhibits ovulation and thus the women lacks the menstrual cycle during this period. Thus coitus during this time will not lead to conception. Thus, this is a natural method of contraception called lactation amenorrhea.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
