(48488,'biology',101,577,1156,'Choose the correct matched statements from the following.<br>I. IUT-Embryo is transferred into the fallopian tube after in vitro fertilisation.<br>II. GIFT - Zygote are collected and injected in the fallopian tube<br>III. AI - Taking semen from donor and transferring it into female genital tract.<br>IV. ZIFT-Zygote inserted into the Fallopian tube.<br>V. ICSI-one sperm transferred into the ovum.<div class="matching-question"></div>','[{"text": "I, II and III", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "II, III and IV", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "III, IV and V", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "I, II, III, IV and V", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'III. AI - Taking semen from donor and transferring it into female genital tract.<br>IV. ZIFT-Zygote inserted into the Fallopian tube.<br>V. ICSI-one sperm transferred into the ovum.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
