(48491,'biology',101,574,1153,'Identify the correct statements.<br>I. There are many side effects of tubectomy and vasectomy.<br>II. Purpose of tubectomy is to prevent egg and sperm fusion.<br>III. The most important component of the oral contraceptive pills is progesterone.<br>IV. Contraceptive oral pills help in birth control by preventing ovulation.','[{"text": "I, II and III", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "I and II", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "III, IV and II", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "II and IV", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'The correct statements : <br>II. Purpose of tubectomy is to prevent egg and sperm fusion.<br>III. The most important component of the oral contraceptive pills is progesterone.<br>IV. Contraceptive oral pills help in birth control by preventing ovulation.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
