(48751,'biology',80,472,951,'Which of the given statements are correct?<br>I. Xanthophyll absorbs yellow light<br>II.Absorbance of blue light by chlorophyll-a is more than chlorophyll-b<br>III.Absorbance of red light by chlorophyll-a is more than chlorophyll-b<br>IV. Chlorophyll-a and chlorophyll-b absorbs green more than red<br>V. Carotenoids does not absorb yellow orange light at all','[{"text": "I and II only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "I and III only", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "II and IV only", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "III and V only", "isCorrect": false}]',1,'Every pigment absorbs that colour of light<br>opposite to which it reflects. Xanthophyll - It<br>is accessory pigment. It absorbs light of yellow<br>colour. Chlorophyll a absorbs red light more.<br>Chlorophyll b absorbs blue wavelength of<br>light more. Carotenoids - It is also an accessory<br>pigment. It absorbs yellow and yellow-orange<br>light. Chlorophyll-a and chlorophyll-b reflect<br>green.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ type-2',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
