(48797,'biology',80,477,965,'The factor affecting photosynthesis indirectly is_','[{"text": "Temperature", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Sunlight", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "$C{O_2}$ concentration", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Water", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Even though water is one of the reactants in the light reaction, the effect of water as a factor is more through its effect on the plant, rather than directly on photosynthesis. Hence, water has an indirect effect on photosynthesis.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
