(49678,'biology',94,792,1701,'Identify the structure that contains codon (B) chain of amino acid, (A) large (C) small ribosomal unit (D) ribosomal unit in a prokaryote','[{"text": "m-RNA, polypeptide, 50 S, 30 S", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "r-RNA, polypeptide, 50 S, 30 S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "m-RNA, polypeptide, 60 S, 40 S", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "m-RNA, polypeptide, 60 S, 40 S", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'<img src=\'/img/data/biology/94_49678_explanation_1.png\' alt=\'Question Image\' style=\'max-width:100%;\' /> mRNA has codon , A- polypeptide chain, Large ribosomal unit is 50 S , small subunit is 30 S',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/94_49678_question_1.png'),
(49679,'biology',94,792,1701,'The following represents a polysome, how many m-RNA are represented here ?','[{"text": "Only one", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "As many as polypeptides are present", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "It can be variable", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "None of these", "isCorrect": false}]',0,'In a polysome there is a single mRNA and many ribosomes.',NULL,'Easy','MCQ type-3',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508','biology/94_49679_question_1.png'),
(49680,'biology',94,792,1701,'Select the correct options<br>i. The cellular factory responsible for synthesising proteins is the ribosome.<br>ii. The ribosome consists of structural RNAs and about 60 different proteins.<br>iii. In its active state, ribosome exists as two subunits; a large subunit and a small subunit.<br>iv. The ribosome also acts as a catalyst (23S rRNA in bacteria is the enzymeribozyme) for the formation of peptide bond.','[{"text": "i & iii are correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "i, ii & iii are correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "i,ii ,iii & iv are correct", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "i & iv are correct", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'The ribosome consists of structural RNAs and about 80 different proteins. In its inactive state, it exists as two subunits; a large subunit and a small subunit.',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
