(49709,'biology',94,793,1702,'In Operon concept, regulator gene functions as','[{"text": "Regulator", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Inhibitor", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Repressor", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "All of these", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Regulator genes, in Operon concept, are the genes involved controlling the expression of one or more genes. Generally, regulator genes code for repressor proteins, Inhibit the activity of operator in prokaryotes',NULL,'Easy','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
