(50397,'chemistry',44,393,784,'According to Bohr’s atomic theory, the correct statement is','[{"text": "Potential energy of electron ${\\\\rm{\\\\alpha }}\\\\frac{{{{\\\\rm{Z}}^{\\\\rm{2}}}}}{{{{\\\\rm{n}}^{\\\\rm{2}}}}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "The product of velocity of electron and principal quantum number (n) ${\\\\rm{\\\\alpha }}\\\\,{{\\\\rm{Z}}^{\\\\rm{2}}}$", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Frequency of revolution of electron in an orbit ${\\\\rm{\\\\alpha }}\\\\frac{{{{\\\\rm{Z}}^{\\\\rm{2}}}}}{{{{\\\\rm{n}}^{\\\\rm{3}}}}}$", "isCorrect": true}, {"text": "Coulombic force of attraction on the electron ${\\\\rm{\\\\alpha }}\\\\frac{{{{\\\\rm{Z}}^{\\\\rm{2}}}}}{{{{\\\\rm{n}}^{\\\\rm{2}}}}}$", "isCorrect": false}]',2,'${\\rm{v}} \\propto \\frac{{\\rm{Z}}}{{\\rm{n}}}{\\rm{;r}} \\propto \\frac{{{{\\rm{n}}^{\\rm{2}}}}}{{\\rm{Z}}}$<br>$({\\rm{1}}){\\rm{P}}.{\\rm{E}}. \\propto \\frac{{\\rm{1}}}{{\\rm{r}}} \\propto \\frac{{\\rm{Z}}}{{{{\\rm{n}}^{\\rm{2}}}}}$<br>$({\\rm{2}})\\,{\\rm{vn}} \\propto {\\rm{Z}}$<br>(3) Frequency of revolution <br>${\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{\\rm{v}}}{{{\\rm{2\\pi }}{{\\rm{r}}_{\\rm{n}}}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{{\\rm{Z/n}}}}{{{\\rm{2\\pi }}\\left( {{{\\rm{n}}^{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{/Z}}} \\right)}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{{{\\rm{Z}}^{\\rm{2}}}}}{{{\\rm{2\\pi }}{{\\rm{n}}^{\\rm{3}}}}}$<br>Frequency $ \\propto \\frac{{{{\\rm{n}}^{\\rm{2}}}}}{{{{\\rm{Z}}^{\\rm{3}}}}}$<br>(4) Coulombic force of attraction <br>${\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{{\\rm{Z}}{{\\rm{e}}^{\\rm{2}}}}}{{{\\rm{(4\\pi }}{{\\rm{\\varepsilon }}_{\\rm{0}}}{\\rm{)}}{{\\rm{r}}^{\\rm{2}}}}} \\propto \\frac{{\\rm{Z}}}{{{{\\rm{r}}^{\\rm{2}}}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{\\rm{Z}}}{{{{\\rm{n}}^{\\rm{4}}}{\\rm{/Z}}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{{{\\rm{Z}}^{\\rm{2}}}}}{{{{\\rm{n}}^{\\rm{4}}}}}$',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',NULL,NULL,'2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
