(50516,'chemistry',44,394,787,'At temperature T, the average kinetic energy of any particle is  $\\frac{{\\rm{3}}}{{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{kT}}{\\rm{.}}$ The de Broglie wavelength follows the order:','[{"text": "Visible photon > Thermal neutron > Thermal electron", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Thermal proton > Thermal electron > Visible photon", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Thermal proton > Visible photon > Thermal electron", "isCorrect": false}, {"text": "Visible photon > Thermal electron > Thermal neutron", "isCorrect": true}]',3,'Kinetic energy of any particle ${\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{\\rm{3}}}{{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{kT}}$<br>Also, ${\\rm{K}}{\\rm{.E}}{\\rm{. = }}\\frac{{\\rm{1}}}{{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{m}}{{\\rm{v}}^{\\rm{2}}}$<br>$\\frac{{\\rm{1}}}{{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{m}}{{\\rm{v}}^{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{\\rm{3}}}{{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{kT}} \\Rightarrow {{\\rm{v}}^{\\rm{2}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{{\\rm{3kT}}}}{{\\rm{m}}}$<br>${\\rm{v = }}\\sqrt {\\frac{{{\\rm{3kT}}}}{{\\rm{m}}}} $<br>De-broglie wavelength ${\\rm{ = \\lambda  = }}\\frac{{\\rm{h}}}{{{\\rm{mv}}}}{\\rm{ = }}\\frac{{\\rm{h}}}{{{\\rm{m}}\\sqrt {\\frac{{{\\rm{3kT}}}}{{\\rm{m}}}} }}$<br>${\\rm{\\lambda  = }}\\frac{{\\rm{h}}}{{\\sqrt {{\\rm{3kTm}}} }}\\,,\\,{\\rm{\\lambda }}\\, \\propto \\frac{{\\rm{1}}}{{\\sqrt {\\rm{m}} }}$<br>Mass of electron < mass of neutron ${\\rm{\\lambda }}$ (electron) > ${\\rm{\\lambda }}$ (neutron)',NULL,'Hard','MCQ',2015,'JEE','2026-07-25 18:34:34.081508',NULL),
